    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52612" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλῐ-</span></b> , in compds., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beautiful</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλο-</span>
